sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant WebShop
    participant AccountService
    participant CartService
    Browser->>WebShop: Login request
    WebShop->>AccountService: Authenticate user
    AccountService-->>WebShop: Customer ID
    WebShop->>CartService: Merge session cart into customer cart
    Note over CartService: Add session items to customer cart, delete session cart
    CartService-->>WebShop: Merge response
    WebShop-->>Browser: Login cookie set
